        log.warning(e.getMessage());
        return false;
    }
}
``` 

### Summary:
The bug in the original implementation was caused by using the incorrect path resolution logic when copying files from the source directory to the target directory. By fixing the resolution of the target path to use `destPath` instead of `sourcePath`, the issue has been resolved.
